Package: liquid-uninstaller
Version: 1.6.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 2728
Maintainer: Miaomiao <kali@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt6, pkexec, desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, libc6 (>= 2.34)
Suggests: flatpak, snapd
Description: 喵喵 — technical instrument-panel application uninstaller for Debian
 喵喵 (Miaomiao) is a graphical uninstaller with a cold, precise instrument
 panel interface, designed for Kali Linux 2026.3 / KDE Plasma 6 and
 dependency-compatible Debian-based systems. The interface follows the system
 locale and supports Chinese and English.
 .
 It supports APT, Flatpak, Snap, local bundles and AppImages, previews reverse
 dependencies and running processes, scans user-level configuration leftovers,
 protects shared XDG directories, and quarantines residual files with restore
 support. System package removal is delegated to the native package managers
 through Polkit.
 .
 It includes a native C filesystem accelerator for fast residual sizing, an
 in-app self-uninstall flow, and in-place Debian upgrades that remove 1.1.x
 files automatically. The application is intentionally conservative: it never recursively deletes
 shared user folders, never edits system configuration directly, and excludes
 the uninstaller itself from its own application list.
